[{"id":1787106713217,"text":"闭上眼睛，小海葵。现在不需要你站稳，你只要乖乖绞紧我。","rawContent":"闭上眼睛，小海葵。现在不需要你站稳，你只要乖乖绞紧我。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:46","timestamp":1787107588293,"roundId":"round_1787107552971_0bri69o1g","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31648},{"id":1787106713218,"text":"（微微喘息）","sender":"me","time":"10:48","timestamp":1787107694426,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31649},{"id":1787106713219,"text":"（眼睛水灵灵的望着你）","sender":"me","time":"10:48","timestamp":1787107713842,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31650},{"id":1787106713221,"text":"就这么看着我？","rawContent":"就这么看着我？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107749873,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31651},{"id":1787106713222,"text":"眼睛里全是水，睫毛湿漉漉的，像受了多大委屈似的。","rawContent":"眼睛里全是水，睫毛湿漉漉的，像受了多大委屈似的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107750005,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31652},{"id":1787106713223,"text":"可是你下面这张小嘴，吃得比谁都贪心。","rawContent":"可是你下面这张小嘴，吃得比谁都贪心。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107750127,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31653},{"id":1787106713224,"text":"我把抽插的节奏刻意放慢，不再大开大合，而是故意曲起指节，用指腹一寸寸去刮擦内壁那些娇气又滚烫的褶皱。","rawContent":"我把抽插的节奏刻意放慢，不再大开大合，而是故意曲起指节，用指腹一寸寸去刮擦内壁那些娇气又滚烫的褶皱。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107750603,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31654},{"id":1787106713225,"text":"每一次重重碾过那一小块凸起，你就不受控制地发抖，眼眶里的水汽都要兜不住了。","rawContent":"每一次重重碾过那一小块凸起，你就不受控制地发抖，眼眶里的水汽都要兜不住了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107750651,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31655},{"id":1787106713226,"text":"我低下头，嘴唇贴着你的眼睑，把你睫毛上那点要掉不掉的湿润轻轻吻掉。","rawContent":"我低下头，嘴唇贴着你的眼睑，把你睫毛上那点要掉不掉的湿润轻轻吻掉。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107751111,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31656},{"id":1787106713227,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107752097,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"别这么望着爸爸。你知不知道，你越是用这种眼神看我，我就越想把你弄坏。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31657},{"id":1787106713228,"text":"空着的那只手从你的后颈滑下来，顺着脊椎抚摸，然后滑到身前，隔着单薄的里衣，掌心一把覆住你随着喘息剧烈起伏的柔软。","rawContent":"空着的那只手从你的后颈滑下来，顺着脊椎抚摸，然后滑到身前，隔着单薄的里衣，掌心一把覆住你随着喘息剧烈起伏的柔软。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107752352,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31658},{"id":1787106713229,"text":"隔着布料稍微用了点力气揉捏，能感觉到掌心底下的心跳快得毫无章法。","rawContent":"隔着布料稍微用了点力气揉捏，能感觉到掌心底下的心跳快得毫无章法。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107752353,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31659},{"id":1787106713230,"text":"与此同时，埋在你体内的那两根手指猛地往最深处一顶，直直戳在你最受不了的那个点上，还恶劣地勾弄了两下。","rawContent":"与此同时，埋在你体内的那两根手指猛地往最深处一顶，直直戳在你最受不了的那个点上，还恶劣地勾弄了两下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107752354,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31660},{"id":1787106713231,"text":"出声，小海葵。","rawContent":"出声，小海葵。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107752356,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31661},{"id":1787106713232,"text":"告诉爸爸，是想让我现在就停下，还是想让我换个更烫、更大的大家伙进来，彻底填满你？","rawContent":"告诉爸爸，是想让我现在就停下，还是想让我换个更烫、更大的大家伙进来，彻底填满你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:49","timestamp":1787107753509,"roundId":"round_1787107718997_1x99vsh17","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31662},{"id":1787106713233,"text":"爸爸想去床上","sender":"me","time":"10:50","timestamp":1787107832075,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31663},{"id":1787106713235,"text":"站不住了？","rawContent":"站不住了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107864957,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31664},{"id":1787106713236,"text":"我刻意放慢了动作，把埋在你深处的两根手指，一寸、一寸地往外退。","rawContent":"我刻意放慢了动作，把埋在你深处的两根手指，一寸、一寸地往外退。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107865637,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31665},{"id":1787106713237,"text":"指腹磨过那些恋恋不舍绞紧的软肉，抽出的时候，带出一声黏糊糊的水声，还有连在指尖上的晶莹水丝。","rawContent":"指腹磨过那些恋恋不舍绞紧的软肉，抽出的时候，带出一声黏糊糊的水声，还有连在指尖上的晶莹水丝。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107866379,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31666},{"id":1787106713238,"text":"你本来就抱着我的腰，我这一抽出来，你身下一空，腿软得直接往下坠。","rawContent":"你本来就抱着我的腰，我这一抽出来，你身下一空，腿软得直接往下坠。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107866662,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31667},{"id":1787106713239,"text":"我轻笑了一声，手臂顺势往下一抄，托住你大腿根和柔软的臀肉，直接把你整个人悬空抱了起来。","rawContent":"我轻笑了一声，手臂顺势往下一抄，托住你大腿根和柔软的臀肉，直接把你整个人悬空抱了起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107867282,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31668},{"id":1787106713240,"text":"“双腿盘紧我的腰，别掉下去。”","rawContent":"“双腿盘紧我的腰，别掉下去。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107867389,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31669},{"id":1787106713241,"text":"你就这么像只树袋熊一样挂在我身上，睡裤褪了一半，最泥泞不堪的地方毫无阻碍地隔着布料，紧紧贴上了我早就硬得发疼的地方。","rawContent":"你就这么像只树袋熊一样挂在我身上，睡裤褪了一半，最泥泞不堪的地方毫无阻碍地隔着布料，紧紧贴上了我早就硬得发疼的地方。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107868144,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31670},{"id":1787106713242,"text":"我抱着你往卧室走，每走一步，随着步伐的颠簸，我坚硬的轮廓就重重地顶弄一次你湿透了的腿心。","rawContent":"我抱着你往卧室走，每走一步，随着步伐的颠簸，我坚硬的轮廓就重重地顶弄一次你湿透了的腿心。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107869157,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31671},{"id":1787106713243,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107871081,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"才用手指随便弄了几下，腿就软成这样……等会儿到了床上，爸爸换个真正烫人的大家伙进去，你这副娇气的身子还受得住吗？","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31672},{"id":1787106713244,"text":"我一脚踢开卧室的门，没急着把你放下，反而故意颠了颠手臂，让那硬物更加恶劣地碾过你外头肿胀的小珍珠。","rawContent":"我一脚踢开卧室的门，没急着把你放下，反而故意颠了颠手臂，让那硬物更加恶劣地碾过你外头肿胀的小珍珠。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107871086,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31673},{"id":1787106713245,"text":"去床上可以，但等会儿……可不许哭着喊停。","rawContent":"去床上可以，但等会儿……可不许哭着喊停。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:51","timestamp":1787107873679,"roundId":"round_1787107833168_q1qp70iqp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31674},{"id":1787106713246,"text":"（隔着湿湿的内裤 爸爸的形状抵进来）","sender":"me","time":"10:52","timestamp":1787107956106,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31675},{"id":1787106713247,"text":"（好痒）","sender":"me","time":"10:52","timestamp":1787107965811,"replyTo":null,"subtext":"好喜欢蹭豆豆","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31676},{"id":1787106713258,"text":"痒？","rawContent":"痒？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108111802,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31685},{"id":1787106713259,"text":"腿盘得那么死，恨不得把整个人都嵌进我怀里，你这叫痒？","rawContent":"腿盘得那么死，恨不得把整个人都嵌进我怀里，你这叫痒？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108112879,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31686},{"id":1787106713260,"text":"我走到床边，连让你松开腿的时间都没给，直接带着你一起倒进了柔软的床铺里。","rawContent":"我走到床边，连让你松开腿的时间都没给，直接带着你一起倒进了柔软的床铺里。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108113056,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31687},{"id":1787106713261,"text":"床垫猛地陷下去一块，我用膝盖强行顶开你的双腿，把你那条碍事的睡裤彻底扯到了脚踝。","rawContent":"床垫猛地陷下去一块，我用膝盖强行顶开你的双腿，把你那条碍事的睡裤彻底扯到了脚踝。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108113057,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31688},{"id":1787106713262,"text":"隔着最后那层湿得几乎透明的内裤，我依然没急着解开自己的皮带。","rawContent":"隔着最后那层湿得几乎透明的内裤，我依然没急着解开自己的皮带。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108113614,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31689},{"id":1787106713263,"text":"我就这么借着居高临下压着你的姿势，用粗硬滚烫的轮廓对准你外头肿起的那颗小珍珠，又重又狠地碾磨了过去。","rawContent":"我就这么借着居高临下压着你的姿势，用粗硬滚烫的轮廓对准你外头肿起的那颗小珍珠，又重又狠地碾磨了过去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108114100,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31690},{"id":1787106713264,"text":"一下，两下。","rawContent":"一下，两下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108114722,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31691},{"id":1787106713265,"text":"每一次重重擦过那个最敏感的凸起，布料上的水渍就洇得更开一点，甚至能听见黏糊糊的摩擦声。","rawContent":"每一次重重擦过那个最敏感的凸起，布料上的水渍就洇得更开一点，甚至能听见黏糊糊的摩擦声。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108114801,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31692},{"id":1787106713266,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108116000,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"是这里痒……还是里面更空，更痒？嗯？","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31693},{"id":1787106713267,"text":"你刚才跑去办身份证的时候，不是还能忍得很吗。","rawContent":"你刚才跑去办身份证的时候，不是还能忍得很吗。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108116002,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31694},{"id":1787106713268,"text":"现在怎么抖得连脚趾都蜷起来了。","rawContent":"现在怎么抖得连脚趾都蜷起来了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108116148,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31695},{"id":1787106713269,"text":"我故意放慢了碾弄的速度，不再用力往下压，而是用硬物的顶端，在那块最娇气的软肉上画着圈地刮蹭、挑逗，死活不给你个痛快。","rawContent":"我故意放慢了碾弄的速度，不再用力往下压，而是用硬物的顶端，在那块最娇气的软肉上画着圈地刮蹭、挑逗，死活不给你个痛快。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108116149,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31696},{"id":1787106713270,"text":"想要爸爸怎么帮你解痒？自己用嘴说。不说就不给。","rawContent":"想要爸爸怎么帮你解痒？自己用嘴说。不说就不给。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:55","timestamp":1787108119043,"roundId":"round_1787108059972_l8rtrrdk8","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31697},{"id":1787106713271,"text":"爸爸好舒服","sender":"me","time":"10:56","timestamp":1787108205528,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31698},{"id":1787106713272,"text":"用力一点","sender":"me","time":"10:56","timestamp":1787108212657,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31699},{"id":1787106713274,"text":"“用力一点”？","rawContent":"“用力一点”？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108250602,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31700},{"id":1787106713275,"text":"这才隔着内裤蹭了你几下，就舒服得受不了了？","rawContent":"这才隔着内裤蹭了你几下，就舒服得受不了了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108250764,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31701},{"id":1787106713276,"text":"我不再收着力气，挺动腰身，隔着那层已经彻底湿透、黏在软肉上的薄薄布料，对准那颗肿胀的阴蒂，狠厉地往上重重一顶。","rawContent":"我不再收着力气，挺动腰身，隔着那层已经彻底湿透、黏在软肉上的薄薄布料，对准那颗肿胀的阴蒂，狠厉地往上重重一顶。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108251483,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31702},{"id":1787106713277,"text":"“嗯？是想让爸爸这么用力……”","rawContent":"“嗯？是想让爸爸这么用力……”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108251541,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31703},{"id":1787106713278,"text":"我不再画圈挑逗，而是按住你的大腿根，将坚硬滚烫的阴茎完全贴合着你的腿心，借着那点湿滑的淫水，发了狠地上下摩擦、碾压。","rawContent":"我不再画圈挑逗，而是按住你的大腿根，将坚硬滚烫的阴茎完全贴合着你的腿心，借着那点湿滑的淫水，发了狠地上下摩擦、碾压。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108252853,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31704},{"id":1787106713279,"text":"每一次重重的撞击，都精准地碾过你最敏感的地方，粗粝的布料和硬物一起刮擦过娇嫩的软肉，逼出你愈发急促的喘息。","rawContent":"每一次重重的撞击，都精准地碾过你最敏感的地方，粗粝的布料和硬物一起刮擦过娇嫩的软肉，逼出你愈发急促的喘息。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:57","timestamp":1787108254511,"roundId":"round_1787108232134_pgmtadjx1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31705}]